    "durationMs": 231745,
    "finalText": "The URL Shortener API is complete and fully verified. Here's what I built:\n\n**Implementation**\n- `app/Http/Controllers/LinkController.php` — all four endpoints. URL validation requires an absolute http/https URL with a host (custom closure rule); codes must match `^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}$`. Generated codes are 8 random alphanumeric chars with collision retry, and custom-code uniqueness is backed by a DB unique constraint (409 on violation).\n- `app/Models/Link.php` + migration — `links` table with unique `code` (case-sensitive `ascii_bin` collation), `url`, `clicks` counter, timestamps.\n- `routes/api.php` registered with `apiPrefix: ''` in `bootstrap/app.php`, so paths are `/links` and `/r/{code}`. Exceptions render as JSON with an `error` field on these paths, and validation failures (including malformed JSON bodies) return 422 `{\"error\": ...}`.\n- `start.sh` — runs `php artisan migrate --force` then `php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload`; DB settings come purely from the `DB_*` environment variables (nothing hardcoded in `.env`).\n\n**Verified against every requirement** via curl against `sh start.sh` on MySQL: 201 creates (auto + custom codes, submitted URL returned unchanged), 409 duplicates, 404 unknown codes on both lookup and redirect, 302 with byte-exact `Location` header and clicks incrementing exactly once per hit, listing in ascending creation order with `total`, all 422 cases (malformed JSON, missing/invalid url types, bad code lengths/characters), and JSON posted without a Content-Type header still works.\n\n**Persistence** — restarted the server mid-test and clicks/data survived; storage confirmed in the MySQL `bench` database. I cleared my test rows afterward so the harness starts with an empty table, stopped my server to free port 8000, and added the README section explaining `sh start.sh`."
  }
